/**
 * Cross-checks every TypeScript port against golden fixtures generated by the
 * Python projects (`site/scripts/generate_demo_data.py`).
 *
 * The demos re-implement logic that already exists in Python, which risks the
 * two quietly disagreeing. These tests make a divergence a failure.
 */

